        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.56,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "which is full of dummy questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 53.85,
          "en": "with possible answers for all those questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.85,
          "end": 56.76,
          "en": "And you'll see that every question has an ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.76,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "a text and then those mentioned answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "And what's important about those answers is that it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "always the first answer that's correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 72.45,
          "en": "Now of course, when we display those answers to the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.45,
          "end": 74.64,
          "en": "we therefore want to shuffle them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.64,
          "end": 77.94,
          "en": "so that there it's not always the first answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.94,
          "end": 79.38,
          "en": "that's correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 81.18,
          "en": "But here in the raw data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.18,
          "end": 85.83,
          "en": "it is the first answer so that in our web app logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.83,
          "end": 88.74,
          "en": "we can determine whether the user picked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 91.32,
          "en": "the right answer or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.32,
          "end": 94.38300000000001,
          "en": "But we'll work on that logic a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.33,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "But now that we got this array of questions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 102.39,
          "en": "let's come back to this quiz state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.39,
          "end": 107.39,
          "en": "Why is this way of managing the state not optimal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.75999999999999,
          "end": 108.93,
          "en": "in my opinion?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.93,
          "end": 110.7,
          "en": "What could be the reason for that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.7,
          "end": 112.413,
          "en": "What could be wrong here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.18,
          "end": 115.22999999999999,
          "en": "Well, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.22999999999999,
          "end": 118.92,
          "en": "I plan to have two state snapshots here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.92,
          "end": 122.1,
          "en": "The index of the currently active question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.1,
          "end": 126.363,
          "en": "and then an array of answers selected by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 131.67,
          "en": "Now, if you take a closer look at this implementation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.67,
          "end": 133.92,
          "en": "you might see that in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.92,
          "end": 136.11,
          "en": "one of the two pieces of state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.11,
          "end": 139.59,
          "en": "here is redundant because of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.59,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "we will definitely need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "to store the answers picked by a user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 148.62,
          "en": "But when it comes to the active question index,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.62,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "that could actually be derived",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 155.04,
          "en": "from this user answers array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.04,
          "end": 160.04,
          "en": "Because here we will store one answer for every question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 163.59,
          "en": "And therefore, we can simply take a look at the number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.59,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "of stored answers in this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 169.74,
          "en": "and we can derive what the currently active question index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.74,
          "end": 171.66,
          "en": "should be because of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.66,
          "end": 174.36,
          "en": "if we have like two answers in that array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.36,
          "end": 178.23,
          "en": "it's the third question we now want to present to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.23,
          "end": 180.57,
          "en": "because the first two questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.57,
          "end": 182.553,
          "en": "have then already been answered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.54,
          "end": 185.37,
          "en": "Therefore, we can get rid of this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.37,
          "end": 187.77,
          "en": "active question index state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.77,
          "end": 190.47,
          "en": "and instead add some derived state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.47,
          "end": 193.713,
          "en": "a computed value to this component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 198.96,
          "en": "The active question index can simply be a const",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.96,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "where we take the user answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 203.313,
          "en": "and then the length of this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.48,
          "end": 206.7,
          "en": "And therefore, if this is an empty array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.7,
          "end": 208.53,
          "en": "this will give us zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.53,
          "end": 211.82999999999998,
          "en": "and the active question index will be zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.82999999999998,
          "end": 214.11,
          "en": "So it will then be the first question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 215.913,
          "en": "which we want to show to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.81,
          "end": 218.67000000000002,
          "en": "If one answer has been added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.67000000000002,
          "end": 221.46,
          "en": "because the first question has been answered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.46,
          "end": 223.62,
          "en": "this index here will be one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 223.62,
          "end": 228,
          "en": "and therefore the second question in this questions array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228,
          "end": 229.92000000000002,
          "en": "And that's therefore a better way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 234.15,
          "en": "of managing the state because when working with React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.15,
          "end": 236.16,
          "en": "when writing React code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.16,
          "end": 240.66,
          "en": "you typically want to manage as little state as possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.66,
          "end": 245.13,
          "en": "and derive as much state as possible instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 245.13,
          "end": 247.56,
          "en": "And that's what we're doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 247.56,
          "end": 250.26,
          "en": "And therefore, with this change here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.26,
          "end": 252.87,
          "en": "which optimizes our code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.87,
          "end": 257.01,
          "en": "we can now finally work on presenting a question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.01,
          "end": 259.65,
          "en": "to the user and therefore we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.65,
          "end": 262.47,
          "en": "of course import this questions array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.47,
          "end": 265.44,
          "en": "and then output the text of the question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 265.44,
          "end": 269.838,
          "en": "with the currently active question index on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.838,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "Therefore, here in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 277.22,
          "en": "in the quiz component, we can import our dummy questions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.77,
          "end": 280.59000000000003,
          "en": "maybe named like this to make it clear that this is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.59000000000003,
          "end": 285.59000000000003,
          "en": "some dummy raw data we're importing from going up one level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 285.99,
          "end": 288.873,
          "en": "and then there are the questions.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.43,
          "end": 293.55,
          "en": "And then here, instead of outputting this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 293.55,
          "end": 296.79,
          "en": "we can output a H2 tag, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.79,
          "end": 300.51,
          "en": "where we then output questions,",
